Output clips/02-status.mp4
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1280
Set Height 720
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Set Padding 16
Set Framerate 30
Set Shell "bash"
Set WindowBar Colorful

Hide
Type "export HOME=/tmp/opencastle-demo/home PATH=/tmp/opencastle-demo/bin:$PATH PS1='$ ' && cd /tmp/opencastle-demo/acme-shop && clear"
Enter
Sleep 600ms
Show

Sleep 500ms
Type "cat CLAUDE.md .cursorrules"
Enter
Sleep 2800ms
Type "npx opencastle"
Enter
Sleep 9564ms
